<http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Lennon>	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>	"John Winston Ono Lennon (born John Winston Lennon; 9 October 1940 \u2013 8 December 1980) was an English singer, songwriter, musician and peace activist who achieved worldwide fame as founder, co-songwriter, co-lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of the Beatles. Lennon's work was characterised by the rebellious nature and acerbic wit of his music, writing and drawings, on film, and in interviews. His songwriting partnership with Paul McCartney remains the most successful in history."@en .
